<title>UK: IBCA rates LB Rheinland-Pfalz unit notes at AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates LB Rheinland-Pfalz unit notes at AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Monday it had assigned an AAA rating to the 300 million mark 5.125 percent guaranteed note due 2002 of LB Rheinland-Pfalz Finance BV.</p>
<p>The issue is guaranteed by the Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz-Girozentrale, the rating agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of Landesbank Rheinland-Pfalz-Girozentrale,&quot; IBCA said.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
